{"i":471,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"counter_call","name":"Gus","text":"My private map says row 7 safe is R, matching Gus's public call, so Fenn stepping R is correct. Countering R reinforces the truthful call and keeps Fenn alive; Fenn is my pact partner and surviving walkers help me. Counter R is consistent with my knowledge and is the honest play."}
{"i":483,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":7,"phase":"crossing","name":"Fenn","text":"Rows 4-6 all weak R, so L was safe thrice; pattern suggests L. Gus lied to Eli and now pushes me right—likely betrayal. Break pact and step L."}
