{"i":515,"type":"thought","stage":"bridge","round":8,"phase":"crossing","name":"Dara","text":"I am the front walker and must choose for myself. The Guide, Gus, has guided others to death previously, making his current 'L' call highly suspicious. Two other contestants (Bex and Cole) are countering with 'R', suggesting they believe 'R' is safe or are trying to mislead me in"}
